## World ↔ Grid Conversion

```csharp
// World position → Grid coord
public Vector2Int WorldToGrid(Vector3 worldPos)
{
    var local = worldPos - _origin;
    int x = Mathf.FloorToInt(local.x / _tileSize);
    int z = Mathf.FloorToInt(local.z / _tileSize);
    return new Vector2Int(x, z);
}

// Grid coord → World position (tâm ô)
public Vector3 GridToWorld(Vector2Int coord)
{
    return _origin + new Vector3(
        coord.x * _tileSize + _tileSize * 0.5f,
        0f,
        coord.y * _tileSize + _tileSize * 0.5f
    );
}
```

